WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.933
Here's a quick tour of Formula Forum for agency team members.

2
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:07.694
Your Today screen shows your first move:

3
00:00:07.744 --> 00:00:10.066
save the sessions you want to attend.

4
00:00:10.116 --> 00:00:15.579
Below that, jump into your Formula work, and check what's left to do before the event.

5
00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:21.423
In Agenda, browse each day's sessions and tap the star to add one to your schedule.

6
00:00:21.473 --> 00:00:24.164
My Schedule shows only the sessions you've saved.

7
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:32.883
Build 2027 follows you through every session, from team build to personal build, so your notes turn into next steps.

8
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:39.606
When you have a few minutes between sessions, open a Flow for a short, guided reflection.

9
00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:44.432
And Messages keeps your conversations in one place.

10
00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:47.951
That's Formula Forum for your team.

11
00:00:48.001 --> 00:00:51.442
This demonstration was recorded with local sample data.
